  "ruleText": "Mvi 209.08 RSA 357-C:10, Franchisee’s Right to Associate. The scope of hearings held pursuant to RSA 357-C:10 shall be limited to whether a franchisor has attempted to interfere with franchisees right to associate for any lawful purpose.\n\nSource. #6980, eff 4-21-99, EXPIRED: 4-21-07\n\nNew. #8978, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRES: 3-12-08; ss by #9043-B, eff 11-29-07; EXPIRED: 11-29-15\n\nNew. #11195, INTERIM, eff 10-15-16, EXPIRES: 4-3-17; ss by #12123, eff 3-2-17",
